WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
I won't protect people

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:04,660
Brother Gu is the best at protecting people for so many years

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:06,020
He protected me well

4
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,900
I have never been wronged in the slightest, Brother Gu

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,100
I don’t want you to go to the Northern Territory

6
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,260
I've heard of it

7
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,060
That's the scariest part of the building

8
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,180
It is the burning place that all samurai fear.

9
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:15,740
Brother, Grandpa Yang

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,060
What do you think?

11
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,300
Theoretically

12
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:20,940
This guy is a veteran

13
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,100
Nothing to say about my ability

14
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,060
But he is a bad wolf

15
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,180
Still wild

16
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:26,820
I'm afraid you can't control him

17
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,400
No matter how powerful

18
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,080
Is he still a person with feelings after all? But why?

19
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,880
There is a vague feeling of familiarity

20
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,210
If I can keep him safe

21
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,270
Can you protect me for a year?

22
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:47,780
See what he does Gu Shiyi

23
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:49,540
I'm making a promise to you

24
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,900
I can keep him safe so

25
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:53,620
can you keep me safe
